  "details": "Long story short, I have lot of amazing tools that I purchase but I need to update all of them individually into each avatar all the time... It would be nice if there could be some \"Toolkit\" that you can install prefabs there, and then summon then in game with any avatar.\nMaybe a menu in the account with few slots so it wont be so heavy?\nExample:\nI like VRClens / magnifying glass for inspecting meshes / The VRchat phone to call friends on instance / Summon a sword.\nI place those items with a collider to specify how to hold them and then in game with any Item I can summon those tools. Instead of installing those 4 in EACH avatar configuring EACH menu and EACH toogles.",
